# Bonecache Overseer {B} (1/1): "Activate only if ... you've sacrificed a Food this turn." Bot1 sacrifices a Food on turn 1 (the one
# City Pigeon left when it was Bolted, for 3 life), so on turn 3 that Food no longer counts and the Overseer is refused. Then Bot2
# sacrifices its own Food (from Gilded Goose) on Bot1's turn: an opponent's sacrifice is not "you've sacrificed", so the Overseer is
# still refused and Bot1 loses no life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Bonecache Overseer
Mox Pearl
City Pigeon
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Black Lotus
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Gilded Goose
Island x16

